      "text": "每次潜入沉没迷宫都要在黑暗怪物与氧气耗尽间赛跑",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Plunge into the cursed Abyssal Pool, where every descent is a deadly gamble. Navigate sunken ruins, face eldritch horrors in darkness, and race against dwindling oxygen.",
