    {
      "text": "幸存者永久死亡，健康、理智与牺牲名单都由玩家决定",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Lead desperate survivors where death is permanent and sacrifice is inevitable. Manage health and sanity. Decide who joins, who dives, who dies.",
