      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把脆弱营地建成人类最后避难所，按时间分配岗位与设施升级",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Transform your fragile camp into humanity's last refuge. Assign vital roles to your survivors, improve their skillset and craft them new tools & equipment. Balance resources against time to upgrade essential structures.",
